(50, 'product_main_description', '<p>The eCommerceGo API module empowers developers and businesses to extend and customize the functionality of their ecommerce platform. By leveraging our robust and scalable API, you can seamlessly integrate with third-party applications, streamline operations, and create a more tailored shopping experience for your customers.</p>', 'Api', '2026-06-10 16:08:46', '2026-06-10 16:08:46'),
