(1411, 'dedicated_theme_description', '<p>By encouraging visitors to subscribe to your newsletter, you are not only building your email list but also laying the groundwork for future conversions. With regular updates and exclusive offers delivered directly to their inbox, subscribers are more likely to return to your store and make a purchase.</p>', 'Subscribe', '2026-06-10 17:18:43', '2026-06-10 17:18:43'),
(1412, 'dedicated_theme_sections', '[{\"dedicated_theme_section_image\":\"\",\"dedicated_theme_section_heading\":\"Build Relationships\",\"dedicated_theme_section_description\":\"A newsletter is more than just a promotional tool—its a way to connect with your audience on a deeper level. Use your newsletter to share valuable content, insider tips, and behind-the-scenes insights that resonate with your customers and strengthen your brand-customer relationships.\"},{\"dedicated_theme_section_image\":\"\",\"dedicated_theme_section_heading\":\"Measure Success\",\"dedicated_theme_section_description\":\"Our Subscribe Popup module comes equipped with powerful analytics features that allow you to track the performance of your popup in real time. From subscription rates to conversion metrics, you will gain valuable insights that help you refine your marketing strategy and optimize your campaigns for success.\"}]', 'Subscribe', '2026-06-10 17:18:43', '2026-06-10 17:18:43'),
